The game where I met the troll with the wand of death turned into
a very convenient game. In the end I had five wands of death (at
least four in the hand of some monsters, but only the very first
one was a problem), three wands of wishing (one from a bones level
statue in Death Valley). I got my seven candles without wishes;
a couple in minetown, one or two lying around, one from a poly'd
unihorn, one death drop (AFAIR). The bones level had also Magicbane.
The game had an abundance of magic armor (three sets of GoDex, GoP,
two HoBril, silver scale mail and CoMR from the bones (after I had
wished for GDSM to face the troll), two SoRefl, ...and most of the
rest in at least one piece). Just a pitty that my pet XL:37 HP:~300
arch-lich didn't make it to the second altar; I wonder how he got
killed with his self-healing spell... - maybe a Rider attack? (All
three Riders had been chasing me.)

